{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever heard about that guy who lost his hard drive filled with PitCoins worth 1 million $ ? Well, you ARE that guy, and now you've gone all-in on buying a sketchy junkyard just to find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692070/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1745693726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Armed with nothing but a janky vacuum cleaner and an unreasonable amount of hope, you dive into mountains of weird, hilarious, and sometimes shockingly valuable trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell what you find, upgrade your gear and explore your pit one careful step at a time like your future depends on it\u2014because it kind of does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692070/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1745693726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For anyone who's ever lost something... or gone looking for more. No timers. No pressure. Just you, the dirt, and the quiet thrill of discovery. But be careful. You never know what\u2019s waiting for you in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692070?t=1745693726","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692070/d396fda15ba0ec4c6a88c402ee5b72bfce263402/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745693726","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692070/2d2a05dbb9715be797d4c8c02aef88239533bf8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745693726","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692070/2d2a05dbb9715be797d4c8c02aef88239533bf8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745693726","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"